<title>USA: AXENT Technologies Inc Q4 oper shr rises.</title>
<headline>AXENT Technologies Inc Q4 oper shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr profit	  $0.14   profit	 $0.04</p>
<p> Net shr  profit	   0.16   profit	  0.16</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,809   profit	 1,429</p>
<p> Revs			 7,738		    5,698</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,093		    9,118</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr profit	  $0.31     loss	 $0.30</p>
<p> Net shr profit	    0.54   profit	  0.26</p>
<p> Net profit		 5,680   profit	 2,355</p>
<p> Revs			22,097		   14,728</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,662		    9,118</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q4 1996 shr for discontinued operations was $0.02 vs $0.12. For the full year 1996, shr for discontinued operations was $0.23 vs $0.56.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
